{"id": "g2_any_overlap_half_open_slots", "signature": "solve(slots)", "statement": "`slots` is a list of [start, end] pairs of integers describing HALF-OPEN intervals [start, end), so end is not included. Pairs with start >= end are empty and are ignored. Return True if there exist two different non-empty entries (different list positions) that share at least one time point, and False otherwise. Touching intervals such as [1, 3) and [3, 5) do not overlap. Return False for an empty list or when no two non-empty intervals overlap.", "tests": [{"args": [[]], "expected": false}, {"args": [[[0, 5], [5, 10]]], "expected": false}, {"args": [[[0, 5], [4, 10]]], "expected": true}, {"args": [[[3, 3], [3, 3]]], "expected": false}, {"args": [[[1, 4], [2, 3]]], "expected": true}, {"args": [[[0, 2], [2, 4], [4, 6]]], "expected": false}, {"args": [[[8, 10], [0, 3], [3, 5], [4, 6]]], "expected": true}, {"args": [[[5, 6]]], "expected": false}, {"args": [[[0, 1], [1, 2], [3, 4], [2, 3]]], "expected": false}, {"args": [[[0, 10], [9, 12], [3, 4]]], "expected": true}, {"args": [[[6, 8], [1, 1], [9, 9]]], "expected": false}, {"args": [[[2, 5], [5, 7], [6, 9]]], "expected": true}, {"args": [[[0, 10], [10, 11], [11, 12]]], "expected": false}], "facts": [["arg", "slots", "interval_list"], ["iterate", "slots"], ["ask", "max_overlap"], ["interval_ends", "half_open"], ["at_least", "2"], ["size", "slots", "tiny"]], "deps": {"schema": ["interval_scan"], "uses": ["interval_max_overlap"], "solution_sha256": "dd52e00f1ee3cc8379202011576e348e0c92360423549b26c21ca84b986e5f5d", "reference_sha256": "2f9b374df8ad6c81adc3636077f3569a100ca658fcc5012d1c6d8c72505856e0"}}